# Example crontab for nightly telemetry export (UTC).
# Install on the host or scheduler container — NOT inside the FastAPI process.
#
#   crontab -e
#   # paste the line below (adjust paths to your deployment root):
#
# 0 2 * * * cd /path/to/brasaland && /usr/bin/env TARGET_DATE= python scripts/nightly_export.py >> /var/log/brasaland/nightly_export.log 2>&1
#
# Expression: minute=0 hour=2 every day (02:00 UTC).
# Rationale: runs after midnight UTC so "yesterday" is complete; low-traffic window
# before the weekly pipeline dashboard refresh on Monday mornings.
#
# Override for backfill / testing:
#   TARGET_DATE=2026-01-15 python scripts/nightly_export.py
